{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/08f3b946f99e5c75745cdd31478c49c6.poster.avif?t=1771019435\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/08f3b946f99e5c75745cdd31478c49c6.webm?t=1771019435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/08f3b946f99e5c75745cdd31478c49c6.mp4?t=1771019435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Sucks</strong> is a cozy single-player trash-recycling adventure about <strong>keeping the cosmos clean and tidy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You play as an <strong>intergalactic trash collector</strong> aboard a retro-futuristic spaceship. Each day brings new types of litter, and it\u2019s your job to <strong>sort, clean, and recycle</strong> it with your trusty wearable vacuum, accompanied by <strong>REN</strong>, your <i>Relentlessly Enthusiastic Navigator</i>. Together, you\u2019ll spend 12 days on the journey back to Earth, balancing piles of space junk with the ups and downs of interstellar companionship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/4cc9d647cbc4d777e9fefd3dc81cce3e.avif?t=1771019435\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay flows through two main phases:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morning Prep</strong> - a quiet, no-time-limit phase where you can chat with REN, harvest fruit in the greenhouse, blend smoothies for daily power-ups, scan nearby planets for recycling opportunities, water plants, recharge machines, and plan your route for the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycling Shifts</strong> - time-limited sessions where waves of new litter spawn across the ship. You\u2019ll need to vacuum, process, and recycle as efficiently as possible to earn Space Coins, which can be spent on machinery upgrades and perks to prepare for the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/0ff031dd519a210470a4206b695c52b8.avif?t=1771019435\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect Space Coins from each recycling shift, you can invest them in upgrades - improving your machines, unlocking new perks, and enhancing your ship to take on bigger challenges. Whether it\u2019s faster recycling gear, sturdier machinery, or ship systems that make your daily routine a little easier, every upgrade helps you <strong>stay ahead of the cosmic clutter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/ef3209da9a6c5d093fac20dad6082731.avif?t=1771019435\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the chaos of recycling shifts, you can unwind in the ship\u2019s lounge - explore strange trinkets discovered among the trash, relax, and uncover more about REN and the lore of your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to tidy the galaxy, one piece of cosmic litter at a time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Space Sucks to your wishlist and follow our socials <strong>@redmeatgames\u00a0</strong>to stay in the loop - REN insists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/97856aeb02421f81e687df1db8b5bd7d.avif?t=1771019435\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462910?t=1771019435","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462910?t=1771019435","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/afc4e659913cb70e104b301b0b24cd777a9c6b4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771019435","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/afc4e659913cb70e104b301b0b24cd777a9c6b4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771019435","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/08f3b946f99e5c75745cdd31478c49c6.poster.avif?t=1771019435\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/08f3b946f99e5c75745cdd31478c49c6.webm?t=1771019435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/08f3b946f99e5c75745cdd31478c49c6.mp4?t=1771019435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Sucks</strong> is a cozy single-player trash-recycling adventure about <strong>keeping the cosmos clean and tidy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You play as an <strong>intergalactic trash collector</strong> aboard a retro-futuristi