ster recycling gear, sturdier machinery, or ship systems that make your daily routine a little easier, every upgrade helps you <strong>stay ahead of the cosmic clutter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/ef3209da9a6c5d093fac20dad6082731.avif?t=1771019435\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the chaos of recycling shifts, you can unwind in the ship\u2019s lounge - explore strange trinkets discovered among the trash, relax, and uncover more about REN and the lore of your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to tidy the galaxy, one piece of cosmic litter at a time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Space Sucks to your wishlist and follow our socials <strong>@redmeatgames\u00a0</strong>to stay in the loop - REN insists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/extras/97856aeb02421f81e687df1db8b5bd7d.avif?t=1771019435\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p>","developers":["Red Meat Games","Honig Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462910/header.jpg?t=1771019435","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3462910/826108/e5ba5d48e51bc7d3123721aacc1dd3a4640293b6/1750853364/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739210097","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3462910/826108/e5ba5d48e51bc7d3123721aacc1dd3a4640293b6/1750853364/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739210097","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t