pace trash as possible on a 12-day journey back to Earth, while navigating the ups and downs of interstellar companionship.","steam_appid":3462910,"support_info":{"email":"meat@redmeatgames.ca","url":"https://redmeat.games/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}